# Git branch push defaults

- Default working / push branch: `test`.
- When the user says push / 推送 / commit 并 push（未点名 master）: only push `test` (`origin/test`).
- Push or merge to `master` **only** when the user explicitly names master（例如「推到 master」「更新 master」「合并到 master」）.
- Do not update `master` as a side effect of a normal push to `test`.
